2026-06-06 07:09:27,696 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### Critical Findings (3)
2026-06-06 07:09:27,697 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **PowerView/PowerSploit Reconnaissance** (f_b2812c6a) — Confirmed. Complete PowerView toolkit executed under compromised `spsql` service account from `base-file.shieldbase.lan` on 2018-08-31, running Invoke-UserHunter, Invoke-ShareFinder, Invoke-CheckLocalAdminAccess, and domain trust mapping.
2026-06-06 07:09:27,699 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 2. **C2 Channel to 172.16.4.10:8080** (f_45e2750d) — Confirmed. Two PowerShell processes (PIDs 4072 and 3164) established HTTP connections to the C2 server. Network connections corroborated across multiple memory snapshots.
2026-06-06 07:09:27,700 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 3. **WMI-Based Remote Execution** (f_92aba01d) — Confirmed. WmiPrvSE.exe spawned the PowerShell stager chain, establishing the Meterpreter-style session.
2026-06-06 07:09:27,701 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### High Findings (4)
2026-06-06 07:09:27,703 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 4. **Metasploit/Cobalt Strike Code Injection Pattern** (f_22fff471) — Inference. WoW64 PowerShell PID 3164 spawned 25+ short-lived rundll32.exe instances over 8 days — classic post-exploitation framework behavior.
2026-06-06 07:09:27,704 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 5. **Data Staging with Rar.exe** (f_3828ca97) — Confirmed. Archive tool Rar.exe (PID 2524, WoW64) ran on 2018-09-05 for ~10 minutes, targeting shared business data including Board Presentations.
2026-06-06 07:09:27,706 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 6. **subject_srv.exe Suspicious Service** (f_5bcb1c4e) — Inference. 32-bit binary at C:\windows\ root, listening on port 3262, making unusual internal connections. SHA256: `87c8fa606729ed63cb9d59f6b731338f8b06addbb3ef91e99b773eac2f2c524d`. Present since April 2018.
2026-06-06 07:09:27,707 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 7. **Compromised spsql Service Account** (f_83e43c8d) — Confirmed. SQL service account weaponized for domain reconnaissance, with profile directories created contemporaneously with PowerView execution.
2026-06-06 07:09:27,709 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 8. **Lateral Movement via SMB/WinRM/RDP** (f_517612d9) — Confirmed. DC used as pivot point with connections across 4+ subnets (172.16.4-7.x, 10.10.x.x).
